/**
 * How Crane in a circle (`tsuru-no-maru`) is constructed, in a line in each language: the text a crest's card shows beside its steps.
 * It is here, not on the crest's record, so that the manifest stays small; `crestConstruction()` loads it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts no-run
 * import { description } from "@johnmorrisdotca/kamon-crests/steps/tsuru-no-maru";
 *
 * console.log(description.en.length > 30, description.ja.endsWith("。")); // true true
 * ```
 */
const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"A crane seen from the front, its wings raised round a round window so that their tips cross over the top of it. In the window the head looks to the left: a circle with a ringed eye and three white slivers at its back for its crest of feathers, a beak of two ruled edges with the white line of the mouth between them, and a neck that is the band between two circles about one point, the inner one touching the head, with a white line down its front into the breast. The white lines between a wing's long feathers are four arcs about one point on the other side of the axis, so that the feathers follow the rim, and one feather of each wing crosses over the window to the other side. Six lines across the lower feathers are arcs about a point high on the other side, and one across the upper feathers an arc about a point low on the other side. The breast is six rows of round scales about the window's centre, each row over the next, with a white tick on each scale, and the tail is a lens at the foot with a white line down it. The right half is built in full, then the head and the neck, and the left half where it stands.","ja":"正面から見た鶴です。翼を上げて丸い窓を囲み、翼の先は窓の上で交差します。窓の中の頭は左を向きます。頭は円で、目は輪と点、後ろの冠羽は白い細い切れ込み三本です。くちばしは定規で引いた二本の辺で、間に口の白い線が一本あります。首は、同じ中心の二つの円の間の帯で、内側の円は頭に接します。首の前には、胸まで白い線が一本伸びます。片方の翼の長い羽の間の白い線は、中心線の反対側の一点を中心とする四本の弧で、羽は外の円に沿います。それぞれの翼から羽が一枚ずつ、窓の上を越えて反対側へ渡ります。下の羽を横切る六本の線は、反対側の高い一点を中心とする弧で、上の羽を横切る一本の線は、反対側の低い一点を中心とする弧です。胸は、窓の中心のまわりに並ぶ丸いうろこ六列で、上の列が下の列に重なり、うろこにはそれぞれ白い切れ込みが一つあります。尾は下の端のレンズ形で、中に白い線が一本あります。右半分を作図してから、頭と首を作図し、左半分はその場で作図します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
